    <status value="generated"/><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div xml:lang="en" lang="en"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class="res-header-id"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateDAKContent</b></p><a name="SGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateDAKContent"> </a><a name="hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateDAKContent"> </a><div style="display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%"><p style="margin-bottom: 0px"/><p style="margin-bottom: 0px">Profile: <a href="StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the following actors: </p><ul><li><a href="ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html">Business Analyst</a></li><li><a href="ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ClinicalSME.html">Clinical Subject Matter Expert</a></li></ul><table class="grid"><tr><td><b><a name="DAKVAL-01"> </a></b>Verify L1 accuracy</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify that DAK components accurately reflect L1 recommendations.</p>
</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name="DAKVAL-02"> </a></b>Identify gaps and changes</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can identify gaps, key changes, and alternatives in DAK content.</p>
